      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors report 5 cases of shock type anaphylactic reactions after the ingestion of glafenine. Up to the present, acute tubulo-interstitial nephritis had chiefly been reported. The existence of allergy to this medication remains to be proved by the wider application of allergological studies."},
